WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.500
Connect your Mac, Linux, Windows, and iPhone with SpecWithCode Connect using one account sign-in, a one-time six-character device approval code, and same-account machine access.

00:10.000 --> 00:21.500
Open Settings, then Account, and sign in to SpecWithCode Connect. Your machine registers over the encrypted relay and appears online automatically with no IP addresses or VPN setup.

00:22.000 --> 00:33.500
On a second computer with the same Connect account, open Settings, Machines, and Let another of your machines run work here, then pick your main machine. If this desktop is new to that host, approve its six-character code on the main machine first so Allow unlocks.

00:34.000 --> 00:45.500
Type the one-time six-character code shown on the new device into the approval prompt on the main machine within thirty minutes, then press Allow and confirm to finish with no join line needed.

00:46.000 --> 00:52.500
To reach your computers from your iPhone, open Settings, Machines, and Your phone, then approve the device code on each machine.

00:52.800 --> 00:59.800
Main machine on another account or signed out? Link Connect on the worker, then use Join one of your machines and Make a join line.
